{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"horizon-dark","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Horizon Dark","description":"A warm dark theme with coral and teal highlights.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Horizon Dark","path":"themes/horizon-dark.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/horizon-dark.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Horizon Dark\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#1c1e26\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#d5d8da\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#16161c\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#16161c\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#16161c\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#16161c\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#232530\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#2e303e\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#232530\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#16161c\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#16161c\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#e95678\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#e95678\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#e95678\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#2e303e\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#23253080\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#e95678\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#16161c\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#e95678\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#29d398\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#fab795\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#e95678\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#6c6f93\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fab795\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f09483\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b877db\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fac29a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#25b0bc\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f09483\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e95678\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e95678\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fab795\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#26bbd9\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Horizon Dark\n\nA warm dark theme with coral and teal highlights.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Horizon Dark** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Horizon palette by Jonathan Olaleye (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#1c1e26` |\n| Text | `#d5d8da` |\n| Accent | `#e95678` |\n| Keywords | `#b877db` |\n| Strings | `#fab795` |\n| Functions | `#25b0bc` |\n| Types | `#fac29a` |\n| Comments | `#6c6f93` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}